<title>USA: Novametrix, Siemens in pact.</title>
<headline>Novametrix, Siemens in pact.</headline>
<dateline>WALLINGFORD, Conn. 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Novametrix Medical Systems Inc said Wednesday that it has signed a joint development and purchasing agreement with the Electromedical Systems Group of Siemens AG affiliates to develop a combination flow and carbon dioxide module for Siemens' patient monitoring products.</p>
<p>This development will be based on the Novametrix CO2SMO Plus monitor.</p>
<p>The CO2SMO Plus, which is U.S. Food and Drug Administration approved, integrates flow and carbon dioxide measurements from patients on ventilators and provides the clinician with automatic breath-to-breath carbon dioxide production measurement.</p>
